tes and confidence intervals surrounding the estimates\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the increases were significant (pless than 0.05) in nine of 10 states\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Point estimates in bold indicate significant differences.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}